        "created_at": "2019-05-11T07:09:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Goddammit! &nbsp;I miscounted and forgot to play one of my one shots. &nbsp; = (</p>\n<p>I used Lifeline, DV for deck control, Akash’thriya for environment control, and Haka for minion control against&nbsp;GW Voss. It was a pretty easy fight, but time consuming and I’m not looking forward to having to do it over again. &nbsp;</p>",
