        "id": 227412,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-05-11T12:18:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I used Hunted Naturalist, TLT, Young Legs and Dark Vis. Made a list to make sure I got every one-shot played. Final one was Unnatural Upheaval, to drop Environmental Allies. Lifeline spent a lot of time beating on his friends so the villain wouldn't die. XD</p>",
